  "title": "Article 44 — Uniform civil code",
  "jurisdiction": "India",
  "content": {
    "overview": "Article 44 is a Directive Principle. It is not a self-executing code.",
    "study": "Personal laws remain until a competent legislature enacts a uniform code. Do not treat 44 as repealing a personal-law statute.",
